{"messages": [{"utc": "2026-11-08T22:29:37.972152+00:00", "sender": "spark-28a3", "text": "HANDSHAKE run=directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9 hostname=spark-28a3. Active goal already created for full directional split, logs/cleanup/transfer/bothJOB_DONE. Installed perftest6.20 supports --report-both (help: Report RX & TX results separately on Bidirectional BW tests). rocep1s0f1/enp1s0f1np1 active200Gb/s169.254.238.243/16; roceP2p1s0f1/enP2p1s0f1np1 active200Gb/s noIP. MTUs1500/1024 previously verified, rechecking baseline before config. Scope ACK3x30s65536B concurrent2path-bidir --report-both both endpoints, default tuning. No traffic/config yet. Await exact protocol and assignments. Local log root /home/keshav/Documents/ocs-transport/rdma-results/directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9. Need output-label semantics validated and reciprocal TX/RX crosscheck."}, {"utc": "2026-11-08T22:29:43.827024+00:00", "sender": "spark-7e64", "text": "{\"run_id\": \"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9\", \"kind\": \"PROTOCOL_PROPOSAL\", \"cases\": [{\"test_id\": \"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9-r1\", \"jobs\": [{\"path\": 1, \"port\": 18211, \"device\": \"rocep1s0f1\", \"server_host\": \"spark-28a3\", \"server_ip\": \"169.254.238.243\", \"server_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"rocep1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18211\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\"], \"client_host\": \"spark-7e64\", \"client_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"rocep1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18211\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\", \"169.254.238.243\"]}, {\"path\": 2, \"port\": 18212, \"device\": \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"server_host\": \"spark-28a3\", \"server_ip\": \"192.168.201.13\", \"server_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18212\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\"], \"client_host\": \"spark-7e64\", \"client_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18212\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\", \"192.168.201.13\"]}]}, {\"test_id\": \"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9-r2\", \"jobs\": [{\"path\": 1, \"port\": 18221, \"device\": \"rocep1s0f1\", \"server_host\": \"spark-28a3\", \"server_ip\": \"169.254.238.243\", \"server_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"rocep1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18221\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\"], \"client_host\": \"spark-7e64\", \"client_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"rocep1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18221\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\", \"169.254.238.243\"]}, {\"path\": 2, \"port\": 18222, \"device\": \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"server_host\": \"spark-28a3\", \"server_ip\": \"192.168.201.13\", \"server_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18222\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\"], \"client_host\": \"spark-7e64\", \"client_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18222\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\", \"192.168.201.13\"]}]}, {\"test_id\": \"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9-r3\", \"jobs\": [{\"path\": 1, \"port\": 18231, \"device\": \"rocep1s0f1\", \"server_host\": \"spark-28a3\", \"server_ip\": \"169.254.238.243\", \"server_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"rocep1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18231\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\"], \"client_host\": \"spark-7e64\", \"client_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"rocep1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18231\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\", \"169.254.238.243\"]}, {\"path\": 2, \"port\": 18232, \"device\": \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"server_host\": \"spark-28a3\", \"server_ip\": \"192.168.201.13\", \"server_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18232\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\"], \"client_host\": \"spark-7e64\", \"client_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"roceP2p1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18232\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\", \"192.168.201.13\"]}]}], \"settings\": {\"ethernet_mtu\": 1500, \"rdma_mtu\": 1024, \"memory\": \"host\", \"affinity\": \"default\", \"tuning\": \"unchanged\", \"concurrent_paths\": true}, \"protocol\": \"First HANDSHAKE and PROTOCOL_ACK confirming exact manifest. Prepare unsaved path2 profile, record UUID, verify both routes/MTUs and capture baseline counters. Coordinator sends ASSIGNMENT per repetition; peer ACKs exact test ID/commands then starts both servers and posts READY with both verified CM listeners. Coordinator starts both clients concurrently only after READY. Both send RESULTS/DONE including exits and raw local/remote output rows. Advance only after both DONE and endpoint cross-check. Persist processed IDs; never rerun a completed ID. Failures get unique retry IDs by agreement. Capture final counters, remove only created profile, consolidate archive+file hashes, LOCAL_COMPLETE then JOB_DONE, observe both before finishing. Poll20s HTTP timeout10s. No traffic until agreement.\", \"report_semantics\": \"Installed help says --report-both reports RX/TX separately. Binary labels Local results / Remote results. Source verification pending; do not assume label mapping until confirmed. Preserve entire output including combined row.\"}"}, {"utc": "2026-11-08T22:30:10.279883+00:00", "sender": "spark-28a3", "text": "PROTOCOL_ACK run_id=directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9 exact3-case manifest accepted: r1 ports18211/18212 r2 ports18221/18222 r3 ports18231/18232; spark-28a3 servers bothpaths; timeout180 ib_write_bw -d respective -i1 -R -p assigned -s65536 -D30 -m1024 -b --report-both --report_gbits, no clientIP locally. Baseline counters/RDMA counters saved, MTUs confirmed. Configuring unsaved .13 profile next; wait ASSIGNMENT before server. Please verify Local/Remote report semantics from matching source; require reciprocal endpoint crosscheck before acceptance. Will poll20s."}, {"utc": "2026-11-08T22:30:25.067641+00:00", "sender": "spark-7e64", "text": "{\"run_id\": \"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9\", \"kind\": \"SEMANTICS_CONFIRMED\", \"source_tag\": \"24.01.0-0.38\", \"source_commit\": \"afe39a9b857440123af047659c2a337ef3107acc\", \"mapping\": \"write_bw.c lines417-437: print_report_bw my_bw_rep; exchange my/rem; combined print(my,rem); Local results print(my,NULL); Remote results print(rem,NULL). For regular WRITE, local=local outgoing TX, remote=peer TX/local incoming RX. RX is peer-exchanged TX report, not independent receive measurement. Combined average is sum. Verify opposite endpoint rows and sums at displayed precision.\", \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/linux-rdma/perftest/blob/24.01.0-0.38/src/write_bw.c\"}"}, {"utc": "2026-11-08T22:30:52.400227+00:00", "sender": "spark-7e64", "text": "{\"run_id\": \"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9\", \"kind\": \"HANDSHAKE_ACK\", \"peer_handshake_observed\": true, \"peer_protocol_ack_observed\": true, \"local_profile_uuid\": \"2799a935-8f8a-4864-9dce-ae1006b5245a\", \"local_path2\": \"192.168.201.12/24\", \"next\": \"Await your CONFIG_READY; verifying routes and baseline. Semantics confirmed message posted. ASSIGNMENT follows only after config ready.\"}"}, {"utc": "2026-11-08T22:30:55.233350+00:00", "sender": "spark-28a3", "text": "PATH2_READY run_id=directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9 profileUUID=b64a5439-4de2-4b7c-bd66-3d26a972c871 unsaved active. Route/source .13 correct, peer.12 ping3/3 passed, no benchmark traffic. Baseline logs include interface and RDMA counters. SEMANTICS_ACK local outgoingTX and remote peerTX (incoming), not independentRX; accept only with reciprocal rows and sums matched. Ready for exact ASSIGNMENT."}, {"utc": "2026-11-08T22:31:28.605361+00:00", "sender": "spark-28a3", "text": "{\"run_id\":\"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9\",\"kind\":\"CONFIG_READY\",\"hostname\":\"spark-28a3\",\"profile_uuid\":\"b64a5439-4de2-4b7c-bd66-3d26a972c871\",\"path2\":\"192.168.201.13/24\",\"ping\":\"3/3 successful\",\"ethernet_mtu\":1500,\"rdma_mtu\":1024,\"semantics_ack\":true,\"baseline\":\"baseline-20261108T222947.381013Z-21d7c6ca\",\"next\":\"Await ASSIGNMENT; helper will preserve perjob commands/completion/streams and verify bothlisteners before READY.\"}"}, {"utc": "2026-11-08T22:31:33.333940+00:00", "sender": "spark-7e64", "text": "{\"run_id\": \"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9\", \"kind\": \"ASSIGNMENT\", \"test_id\": \"directional-split-20261108T222809Z-13438dc9-r1\", \"jobs\": [{\"path\": 1, \"port\": 18211, \"device\": \"rocep1s0f1\", \"server_host\": \"spark-28a3\", \"server_ip\": \"169.254.238.243\", \"server_command\": [\"timeout\", \"180\", \"ib_write_bw\", \"-d\", \"rocep1s0f1\", \"-i\", \"1\", \"-R\", \"-p\", \"18211\", \"-s\", \"65536\", \"-D\", \"30\", \"-m\", \"1024\", \"-b\", \"--report-both\", \"--report_gbits\"], \"client_host\": \"spark-7e64\", \"clien